    <mxCell id="status_done" value="&lt;b&gt;✅ Complete (Testnet)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
• 13 Solidity contracts written, tested (138 tests), deployed &amp; verified on Base Sepolia&lt;br/&gt;
• Role bindings wired across all 13 contracts (12 AccessControl grants)&lt;br/&gt;
• Backend API (Express/TS): POST /claims full pipeline, GET /claims, GET /claims/:id&lt;br/&gt;
• SNS Service (FastAPI/Python): sentence-transformer embeddings + Qdrant cosine similarity&lt;br/&gt;
• Ponder Indexer: indexes 5 contracts, GraphQL at :42069/graphql, PGlite storage&lt;br/&gt;
• PM2 orchestration: 3 services online, health-checked, ecosystem.config.cjs&lt;br/&gt;
• E2E claim test: 7/7 passing (POST → on-chain → Ponder index verified 2026-04-27)&lt;br/&gt;
• Deployment scripts: phase1–phase4 automated bash scripts&lt;br/&gt;
• SetTestnetBonds.s.sol: iterative step-down from 100–2500 USDC → 1 USDC&lt;br/&gt;
• Bond auto-approve: relay wallet USDC approval wired in backend&lt;br/&gt;
• Testnet soak period: clock started 2026-04-25 (1-week minimum)"
      style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;"
      vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="1090" y="44" width="540" height="210" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="status_pending" value="&lt;b&gt;⏳ In Progress / Pending&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
• Gnosis Safe multisigs (admin + foundation) — pre-mainnet, safe.global&lt;br/&gt;
• DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE handoff from deployer → Gnosis Safe (all 13 contracts)&lt;br/&gt;
• Mainnet deployment (Base Mainnet) — after 1-week soak&lt;br/&gt;
• Chainlink Automation upkeeps (post-mainnet):&lt;br/&gt;
  · finalizeUnchallenged(claimId) — ChallengeWindow keeper&lt;br/&gt;
  · releaseSubmitterBond(claimId) — OracleRouter keeper&lt;br/&gt;
  · recordSnapshot24h/7d() — EmissionController price oracle&lt;br/&gt;
  · mintEmission(rewardsPool) — EmissionController operator&lt;br/&gt;
• Chainlink PLOT/USD price feed registration (post-mainnet, data.chain.link)&lt;br/&gt;
• Frontend / UI — challengers and voters have no interface yet&lt;br/&gt;
• Challenger flow E2E test — ChallengeWindow dispute path untested on-chain&lt;br/&gt;
• Governance flow test — GovernorPlot + TimelockController untested end-to-end"
      style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;"
      vertex="1" parent="1">
